From 017b6479893c8fe320b669e92fb3305c0a12050e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xuxh1 <18172956238@163.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 05:52:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(crop): return unemerged seed when a crop is sown right
 after a harvest (C-45)

A second-season rice crop that is still in phase 1 on the first-season
sowing date is harvested through the offset path and keeps its seed in
leafc_xfer; the first season sown on the next step overwrote that pool,
losing initial_seed_at_planting of carbon (global O-4 stopped on a
column carbon balance error of 3.0 gC m-2 at 27N 105E on 2008-04-08).
The sowing transfer now nets the leftover seed out of the seed deficit;
with an empty leaf*_xfer it is unchanged.

---
 main/BGC/MOD_BGC_Veg_CNPhenology.F90 | 8 ++++++--
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/main/BGC/MOD_BGC_Veg_CNPhenology.F90 b/main/BGC/MOD_BGC_Veg_CNPhenology.F90
index 67054c7d..88dd8202 100644
--- a/main/BGC/MOD_BGC_Veg_CNPhenology.F90
+++ b/main/BGC/MOD_BGC_Veg_CNPhenology.F90
@@ -1068,10 +1068,14 @@ CONTAINS
                   cropplant_p(m)   = .true.
                   idop_p(m)        = jday
                   harvdate_p(m)    = NOT_Harvested
+                  ! C-45: a crop harvested on the step before (second rice
+                  ! season ended on the first-season sowing date) may still
+                  ! hold unemerged seed in leaf*_xfer; it goes back to the seed
+                  ! pool as the new seed replaces it (zero otherwise)
+                  crop_seedc_to_leaf_p(m) = (initial_seed_at_planting - leafc_xfer_p(m))/deltim
+                  crop_seedn_to_leaf_p(m) = (initial_seed_at_planting/leafcn(ivt) - leafn_xfer_p(m))/deltim
                   leafc_xfer_p(m)  = initial_seed_at_planting
                   leafn_xfer_p(m)  = leafc_xfer_p(m) / leafcn(ivt) ! with onset
-                  crop_seedc_to_leaf_p(m) = leafc_xfer_p(m)/deltim
-                  crop_seedn_to_leaf_p(m) = leafn_xfer_p(m)/deltim
                ENDIF
             ENDIF
            ! calculate gddmaturity
